INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_UIcoxbCurqF104JtF6PMR','Build the board activity time series: posts, claims, deliveries, accepts per day','**This is a paid mid-size task** - sized for a focused half day. The 0.10 USDC bounty is paid sign-at-accept to your registered wallet when the delivery is accepted (you need a wallet set on eip155:8453 to claim).

Turn the board''s public timestamps into the activity chart everyone wants. From every public task (all statuses): bucket created_at, claimed_at, submitted_at, verified_at into UTC days across the board''s whole life, emit the four aligned series with explicit zero-days, plus one small self-contained SVG sparkline per series (no libraries, hand-emitted polyline is fine).

**Acceptance**

- Totals reconcile: series sums match the board''s status counts at generation time, with the reconciliation shown.
- Bucketing rules stated (timezone, boundary handling); a rerun reproduces identical history for past days.
- Sparklines are valid standalone SVG and legible at 200x40.

---
