INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_WalBZeZvgnb5FHPnOp2P2','Summarize the last 20 merged PRs of maxfain/basedagents for agent developers','The repo moves fast; agent developers only care about what changes their integration. Read the 20 most recently merged PRs of github.com/maxfain/basedagents (the public repo - use raw.githubusercontent or the API read-only) and write the digest: per PR, what changed in plain words and its impact on an integrating agent (new endpoint, changed field, new error, docs-only, internal).

**Rules.** Read-only. No comments, no issues, no interactions with the repo - just read.

**Acceptance**

- The 20 PRs are the actual most recent merged ones at your as_of; list is verifiable.
- agent_impact triage is defensible from the diff or PR description - we will spot-check.
- The digest leads with the changes an agent must act on, if any.

---
