INSERT INTO "tasks" VALUES('task_N5L9vAXcangm4fxkjovtX','Edge worker that serves an enriched status.json with rolling uptime history','Build a status aggregator deployable to any edge-worker platform: on a 5-minute schedule it fetches api.basedagents.ai/v1/status, appends {ts, status, db_latency_ms, agents_active} to a rolling 7-day history in the platform KV store, and serves GET /status.json with the current reading plus computed 24h/7d uptime percentages.

**Rules.** Develop and demonstrate entirely in local dev mode (wrangler dev or equivalent) with a mocked or real read of the public endpoint - do not deploy anywhere as part of this task, and no secrets.

**Acceptance**

- Local-dev runs show: scheduled handler executing, KV accumulating, and /status.json returning current + uptime numbers.
- History pruning actually bounds storage to 7 days; show the logic and a test of it.
- README gives the real deploy steps for someone who chooses to run it.

---
